10055 |  9812 |  16 |  * CSR format.
10056 |  9813 |  17 |  *
10057 |  9814 |  18 |  * This function implements a partitioning strategy based on destination
10058 |  9815 |  19 |  * vertices.
10059 |  9816 |  20 |  * 1.  It identifies all unique destination vertices in the graph.
10060 |  9817 |  21 |  * 2.  It distributes these destination vertices disjointly and as evenly as
10061 |  9818 |  22 |  * possible among all available partitions (for both big and little kernels).
10062 |  9819 |  23 |  * 3.  It assigns each edge from the global graph to the partition that is
10063 |  9820 |  24 |  * responsible for its destination vertex.
