10065 |  9822 |  26 |  * sources and destinations).
10066 |  9823 |  27 |  * 5.  It performs vertex ID compression for each partition, creating a local ID
10067 |  9824 |  28 |  * space. Destination vertices are mapped first to ensure they occupy the lower
10068 |  9825 |  29 |  * ID range.
10069 |  9826 |  30 |  * 6.  It rewrites the partition's edges using these new local IDs.
10070 |  9827 |  31 |  * 7.  Finally, it converts the rewritten edges into a local CSR format.
10071 |  9828 |  32 |  *
